# Sample table for array jobs: one sample per line, tab-separated.
#
#   SRR        SPECIES               LAYOUT
#
# Task N of `qsub -t 1-N` takes the Nth data line; the header, comment lines
# and blank lines do not count. submit_omniquant.sh generates this file from
# the SRA RunTable when it is missing, so writing it by hand is only needed to
# run a subset of the samples.
SRR	SPECIES	LAYOUT
SRR12345678	Helicoverpa_armigera	PAIRED
SRR12345679	Helicoverpa_armigera	PAIRED
SRR12345680	Spodoptera_frugiperda	SINGLE
